2026-08-25T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-1036) 'The rules
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-1036) '- One model per image. An image that holds two cannot scale one
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-1036) '  without the other.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Load the weights at start, and not per request. Whether the host
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-1036) '  is this box or a rented instance, a load per request buys nothing
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-1036) '  and costs every response.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Serve `/health` and `/predict`. Neither this box's own worker nor
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-1036) '  vast.ai runs a health probe of its own, thus a caller polls
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-1036) '  `/health` until the instance is ready.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Download the weights at build time. A cold start that pulls 24 GB is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-1036) '  a cold start that times out.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Pin every version, and pin the upstream commit. A moved tag changes
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-1036) '  the output with no build change to show for it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:04Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Return 400 for a bad request, and not 500. A 500 sends a caller to
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-1036) '  retry a request that can never work.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-1036) '- Return a USD layer beside the transmission file. RFD66606-1053 gives that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:01:07Z (RFD66606-1036) '  rule.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1036  1 LINE
 Text:Written

